description:
Find a subsystem's units by conditions (all conditions are AND). No conditions — all units. Returns unit "<sub>/<name>", revision and fields.
A where condition is {field, op, value}; all conditions are AND. Kinds:
eq — the field equals the value (scalar): {"field": "zone", "op": "eq", "value": "z9"}
ne — not equal: {"field": "state", "op": "ne", "value": "closed"}
in — one of a list of values: {"field": "shelf", "op": "in", "value": ["x1", "x2"]}
not_in — none of the list
contains — a LIST field (labels, tags, flags) contains the element: {"field": "labels", "op": "contains", "value": "blue"}; eq on a list field with a string never matches
not_contains — the list field does not contain the element
gt / gte / lt / lte — number greater / not less / less / not greater: {"field": "weight", "op": "gt", "value": 2}
exists / missing — the field is set / not set, no value: {"field": "feed", "op": "exists"}
A field of the related unit is about.<field>: {"field": "about.labels", "op": "contains", "value": "blue"}
